revision:6","quote":"FAS为主要分析集；主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势；安全性采用描述统计；次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。","quote_sha256":"067b3f77e20da2222b9c91da7106a0b612b21542c62f4e68cae8bb2ae7c09367","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","span_id":"es_003"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_001","es_002","es_003"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":2},"gap_items":[{"action":"由医学经理与统计师确认复合策略中终点前事件的具体操作定义（如死亡、永久停药、救援治疗是否计入）","category":"decision_pending","gap_id":"gap_42_composite_def","missing_source_classes":[],"target":"4.2节末句'终点前事件按复合策略处理'"}],"heading":"设计依据","missing_source_classes":[],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机、双盲、安慰剂对照、平行组、多中心设计，属II期概念验证与剂量探索研究，KZ-sGC601设置三个剂量组与安慰剂对照，治疗期12周。统计分析以全分析集（FAS）为主要分析集，主要终点NT-proBNP百分比变化采用ANCOVA（基线校正）并检验剂量-反应趋势，安全性采用描述统计，次要终点按预先层级顺序分析。估计目标策略采用治疗策略（treatment policy），即无论是否发生剂量调整或合并用药变化，均按随机分组进行分析；终点前事件按复合策略处理。","rationale":"设计框架、分析集选择、统计方法及估计目标策略均由当前项目已确认研究事实直接支持。治疗策略中'终点前事件按复合策略处理'的操作定义需医学经理与统计师进一步确认。","review_advisories":["本节提及高影响设计信息（主要终点、估计目标）；系统未把重复提及升级为强制确认。","本节重复了多项总体设计事实；建议压缩为与本节直接相关的信息。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_38c1a7a23a4c6bd6","section_number":"4.2","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:12763d083777e65c5425adce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101155_beb2f383","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:revision:6","quote":"SMOKE-r6-1X口服sGC刺激剂（KZ-sGC601）：低剂量2.5 mg qd、中剂量5 mg qd、高剂量10 mg qd，每日晨起随餐口服；每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定剂量调整。","quote_sha256":"107a0d9880df2b95f6e1cd122bcb278290ffb5a3479c184c86be5d676b1b69ae","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","span_id":"es_004"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_004"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":0,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"补充KZ-sGC601非临床PK/PD、毒理学及既往I期临床数据，以论证2.5/5/10 mg三个剂量水平的选择理由","category":"source_missing","gap_id":"gap_421_dose_rationale","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药效学与毒理学报告","既往I期临床研究报告"],"target":"4.2.1节剂量选择依据论证"}],"heading":"剂量选择依据","missing_source_classes":["研究者手册（IB）","非临床药效学与毒理学报告","既往I期临床研究报告"],"proposal_text":"KZ-sGC601为口服sGC刺激剂，设低剂量2.5 mg、中剂量5 mg、高剂量10 mg三个剂量水平，每日晨起随餐口服，每日一次。安慰剂为外观与气味与试验药一致的模拟片，每日一次，给药与访视安排同试验组，联合相同GDMT背景治疗。四个组别按1:1:1:1随机分配。每4周随访评估耐受性，按方案规定进行剂量调整。","rationale":"三个剂量水平、给药频率、安慰剂匹配及1:1:1:1分配比例由当前项目已确认研究事实直接支持。但支持上述剂量选择的非临床药效学/毒理学数据及既往I期临床安全性与PK数据未包含在本次允许来源中，无法在本章节论证剂量选择的科学依据。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（剂量选择依据）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_b635986855e0ea4e","section_number":"4.2.1","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:12763d083777e65c5425adce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101155_beb2f383","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:revision:6","quote":"按1:1:1:1随机分配","quote_sha256":"72c25373ccda39d122959ebb009159ca899766d2229de691c823ffd82e374382","source_id":"current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","span_id":"es_005"},{"locator":"section:随机|block:441|chunk:1","quote":"本研究采用交互式网络应答系统（IWRS）进行区组随机。Part-1 SAD研究、Part-2 MAD研究的每个剂量组参与者按随机分配接受CMS-D017或安慰剂给药。随机分配表由生物统计人员应用SAS统计软件（9.4及以上版本）产生。","quote_sha256":"7e25516aff883ef38cd01d1e5148f546cd19e8736af26ae42a50c4ca7588c324","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302","span_id":"es_006"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_005","es_006"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":1,"project_fact_spans":1},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认随机化实施工具、区组大小、分层因素及随机表生成方法","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_43_random_method","missing_source_classes":["随机化实施方案","IWRS或中心随机系统配置说明"],"target":"4.3节随机化实施方法"}],"heading":"随机化","missing_source_classes":["随机化实施方案","IWRS或中心随机系统配置说明"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用随机化分配，KZ-sGC601低剂量组、中剂量组、高剂量组与安慰剂组按1:1:1:1比例随机分配至四个平行组别。随机化在受试者完成筛选并满足全部入选标准后、于第0天随机入组访视时实施，每位受试者通过中心随机系统获得唯一随机编号并确定其所属治疗组别。","rationale":"1:1:1:1分配比例由当前项目已确认研究事实直接支持。随机化实施工具（如IWRS或中心随机系统）、区组大小、分层因素（如中心、NYHA分级）及随机化生成方法在本项目来源中未明确，公司语料中IWRS区组随机仅为结构参照，不可直接迁移为本项目既定事实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（随机化）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_a78ae501490c3de7","section_number":"4.3","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:12763d083777e65c5425adce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:4a27cdd782c3be","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:8b49478f82c322","company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:97a2bd7fcf7302"]},{"ai_run_id":"airun_20261006101155_beb2f383","content_status":"partial","decision_items":[],"evidence_bindings":[{"locator":"document:mwdoc_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_b8c9b3f47b0875c6:full-draft:12763d083777e65c5425adce","quote":"本研究采用双盲设计。","quote_sha256":"fe6efce93e02fe3c382cf514c2c89d4778531866fbff09bb8ca822e03e54e66a","source_id":"protocol_full_draft_selection:12763d083777e65c5425adce","span_id":"es_007"},{"locator":"section:随机和盲法|block:352|chunk:1","quote":"本研究为双盲随机设计，试验参与者、研究者、监查员以及数据分析人员等对试验参与者接受某剂量试验用药品类别属于试验药物/安慰剂均不知情。","quote_sha256":"202e6203bbc6cbaf71c237f934be73b9c60099c19f1e48aa487003f531a501c6","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:046677b43d417b","span_id":"es_008"},{"locator":"section:6.3.3 揭盲|block:490|chunk:1","quote":"紧急揭盲借助IWRS中","quote_sha256":"60f7f308cc31286e41cd0e263ec3058002ea024fab20328dd9ee9d91a101af72","source_id":"company_corpus:cms_cn_protocol_corpus_20260715_v1:dbed66cc1d7b3a","span_id":"es_009"}],"evidence_review_advisories":[],"evidence_span_ids":["es_007","es_008","es_009"],"evidence_summary":{"corpus_spans":2,"project_fact_spans":0},"gap_items":[{"action":"确认盲态覆盖的具体人员范围及盲态维持措施","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_44_blinding_scope","missing_source_classes":["盲法管理方案"],"target":"4.4节盲态覆盖范围"},{"action":"确认紧急揭盲触发条件、操作平台、记录要求及揭盲后处理","category":"source_not_retrieved","gap_id":"gap_44_unblinding","missing_source_classes":["紧急揭盲操作规程"],"target":"4.4节紧急揭盲流程"}],"heading":"盲法与揭盲","missing_source_classes":["盲法管理方案","紧急揭盲操作规程"],"proposal_text":"本研究采用双盲设计，试验药与安慰剂为外观与气味一致的匹配制剂，受试者接受的治疗分配在双盲期内保持盲态。双盲期自第0天随机给药起至第12周治疗结束访视止，安全随访期（末次给药后2周）内仍维持盲态直至数据库锁定。","rationale":"双盲设计及匹配安慰剂由当前项目已确认研究事实直接支持。盲态覆盖的具体人员范围（如是否包括监查员、数据分析人员）及紧急揭盲操作流程在本项目来源中未明确，公司语料中的相关描述仅为结构参照，不可直接迁移为本项目既定事实。","review_advisories":["本节复述高影响研究设计（盲法与揭盲）；请在合并设计摘要中统一核对。"],"review_level":"standard","review_reasons":[],"section_id":"mwsec_greenfield_proj_user_87445eff5d37_76efc2f7de92ef87","section_number":"4.4","source_ids":["protocol_full_draft_selection:12763d083777e65c5425adce","current_project_study_definition:mwdefinition_7caf4ee56243f34753ab:r6:ab8a1fd8e763e40c","c